  dir_linklibrary_err_nolink.pcpp - break step of dir_linklibrary.pcpp: the
  call to winmm's timeGetTime without @linklibrary "winmm" (Windows only:
  winmm is a Windows library); the linker cannot find the routine

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\dir_linklibrary_err_nolink.pcpp
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
